-b481-45a0-8a3f-baaf4003d65c\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. create a function that uses await inside\n2. put a breakpoint in the function after the `await`\n3. call the function\n4. When the breakpoint is hit, the callsite of the function and everything before that is not in the stack trace\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[signal_call_stack_test_2026-08-25_17-04-25.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31438503/signal_call_stack_test_2026-08-25_17-04-25.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122815/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122815/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}